# Cloudflare static asset response headers (Workers Static Assets and Pages both read this file).
# Cross-origin isolation (COOP/COEP) is deliberately NOT set: only add it if the
# multi-threaded ffmpeg.wasm build is adopted (DESIGN.md §8).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/version.json
  Cache-Control: no-store
